\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-36\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-25\" x=\"1001\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"2112\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(3168,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-36\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-F7\" x=\"4391\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(5392,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"1001\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"7171\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(8228,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-30\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"779\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-36\" x=\"1279\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Then, we apply our formula as follows:</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"27.63ex\" height=\"15.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -7.171ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -3589.9 11896 6677.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 11.562em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><